~ bed
Traveller: Nobody has slept here in a long while. Nobody is going to mind.
=> END

~ woke
Traveller: Gulls. Morning, then.
=> END

~ bed_again
Traveller: [[Same straw as last night.|Getting to know this bed.|It'll do again.]]
=> END

~ woke_again
Traveller: [[Morning.|Light out. Up, then.|Another day of it.]]
=> END

~ chair
Traveller: It'll hold.
=> END

~ rack
Fish, dried to leather, still on the line. Whoever hung them meant to come back.
=> END

~ crates
Hooks, line, a cork float split down the middle. A fisherman's kit, left in a hurry.
=> END

~ table
Rings from a mug, long dry. A knife mark where somebody cut bait and didn't wipe it up.
=> END
